  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is lunch at school. Four boxes are here. The boxes have names. \"Is this my box?\" asks Mia. She reads the name. It says Leo. \"No, it is not.\"",
      "This box is blue. It has a hippo on it. The name says May. \"Is it May's box?\" asks Mia. \"Yes, it is,\" says Leo. This box is green. It has a goat. It has a horse too. The name says Lily.",
      "Look! Mia sees a red box. It has an alien on it. The alien has a balloon. Wow! The name says Mia. \"This is my box!\" \"Good!\" says Leo. Mia smiles."
    ],
    "summary": "Mia looks for her lunch box at school. She reads the name on each box and finds her own box with an alien and a balloon.",
